{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/moonsa-dugasta-dubai-international-city","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"message":"Property details fetch successfully","data":{"id":349,"crm_id":"2182","search_type":"sales","department":"new_developments","status":"pending","title":"Moonsa","slug":"moonsa-dugasta-dubai-international-city","display_address":"Dubai International City","building_type":["apartment","studio"],"completion_year":"Ready  ","developer":"Dugasta","price":803621,"display_price":"803K","lattitude":25.0973376,"longitude":55.3722063,"min_bedrooms":1,"max_bedrooms":2,"display_bedrooms":null,"about":"<p>Moonsa is a stunning 7-storey residential complex developed by Dugasta. Designed with contemporary elegance and functionality in mind, Moonsa caters to diverse lifestyles and preferences. The design of the building combines milky and dark tones with straight lines, and the interior finishing stands out for its comfort and the ability for residents to decorate their homes to their taste. This building offers a variety of modern living spaces, including <strong>1-bedroom apartments, 2-bedroom apartments,</strong> and <strong>studios</strong>. Whether you're a young professional, a growing family, or someone looking for a serene retreat, Moonsa is the ideal place to call home.</p><p>Moonsa also is equipped with a range of top-notch amenities designed to enhance the quality of life for its residents: gym center to help you stay active and healthy, swimming pool with jacuzzi for relaxation and recreation and kids play area, which is a safe and fun space for children to play and socialize.</p><p>Situated in Warsan 4, a residential district strategically located at the intersection of Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Road and Manama Street, Moonsa offers unparalleled convenience and connectivity. The community is well-linked with major streets and motorways, making commuting and travel hassle-free. Dubai Safari Park (10-15 minutes away), City Centre Mirdif (15-20 minutes away), Dragon Mart (10-15 minutes away), Burj Khalifa and Dubai Mall (20-25 minutes away), Central Fruit and Vegetable Market (5-10 minutes away) and Dubai Silicon Oasis (5-10 minutes away), are all conveniently located near Moonsa.</p>","tile_image":null,"banner_image":null,"media_images":null,"images":[{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2182/images/2024/06/11/0YsvTUx3k0rCD06rGhYsNqTglA8jG08mS2oUDEu9.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/11/0YsvTUx3k0rCD06rGhYsNqTglA8jG08mS2oUDEu9.png","__ggfxIndex":0},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2182/images/2024/06/11/bV0tBKGHx632G9coFtLImjbSFCCwHz2HIWqKx3Pm.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/11/bV0tBKGHx632G9coFtLImjbSFCCwHz2HIWqKx3Pm.png","__ggfxIndex":1},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2182/images/2024/06/11/GGe9AA7BpXbk07yF59UaKhjP5NJfZzXMGt1MiCRY.png","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/11/GGe9AA7BpXbk07yF59UaKhjP5NJfZzXMGt1MiCRY.png","__ggfxIndex":2},{"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/i/off-plan/2182/images/2024/06/11/Ukvbn0RWkKv9aX7MbSSrvoEkQCFISiegzzx06ZGA.jpg","srcUrl":"https://cdn.geniemap.net/2024/06/11/Ukvbn0RWkKv9aX7MbSSrvoEkQCFISiegzzx06ZGA.jpg","__ggfxIndex":3}],"characteristics_module":null,"location_tile":null,"brochure":{"id":2749,"url":"https://ggfx-providentestate.s3.eu-west-2.amazonaws.com/2024/06/11/tu4xlGgmiVAi2xlouLL6t7DYUgWIwikjKYwdwUJT.pdf","file":null,"item":[],"image":null},"video_module":{"id":1517,"thumbnail":null,"video_url":null},"floor_plans":[{"id":1533,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"1 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ceiling_height":null,"starting_price":null},{"id":1534,"url":null,"area":null,"size":null,"media":null,"title":"2 Bedroom Apartment","kitchen":null,"parking":null,"flooring":null,"ce